Subject: new torrent-get field ps5_in_folder

True when the files of the torrent lie in its own folder (the path of the first file has a '/').
The stock web interface treats only torrents with more than one file as folders and shows a
single file inside a folder as a file ('Open folder' then opens the parent folder).

